/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (Most travel apps only handle one piece of this with either bookings, or budgeting, or itineraries. So travellers end up manually piecing it all together themselves. Group trips make it worse, since getting everyone's schedules, budgets, and preferences to line up is genuinely difficult. And when something changes mid-trip, there's rarely any real help from existing platforms in adjusting.)
